# ns2d: the compressed job archive is preserved as checksum-verified 48 MB chunks under
# experiments/ns2d/artifacts/<attempt>/; the staged copy of the 31 MB reference npz is
# byte-identical to experiments/ns2d/configs/dev8_eval_ref.npz (MANIFEST-verified in-job).
